          }
        },
        "accordion_cyYJwP": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How To Use",
            "content": "<p><strong>Beautiful Color in 3 Easy Steps</strong></p><p></p><p><strong>01 APPLY<br/></strong>Work ProvenWell evenly through the areas you want to color, making sure gray roots and strands are fully coated.<br/><br/><strong>02 LET THE COLOR DEVELOP<br/></strong>Leave on for 20-30 minutes while ProvenWell develops into rich, natural-looking color.<br/><br/><strong>03 RINSE & REVEAL<br/></strong>Rinse thoroughly and reveal richer, fresher-looking color.</p>",
